Upload index.html and error.html into S3 following the normal process including ACL settings and allowing static hosting. Put index and error filenames in the fields.
Click on index.html → Permissions → Everyone → both tick. Same with error.html.
Bucket → Properties → scroll to Static Website Hosting → copy URL → check.




